:{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":60,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/650/1627024.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/650/1627024.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Ma Dawei's previous life ends in prison and family ruin, but he suddenly returns to the turning point of his fate. He resolutely avoids the pitfalls, grasps the opportunities of the age, and rises with momentum. Against one scheme after another, Ma Dawei cuts off old entanglements, protects his loved ones with all his strength, sails through the ups and downs of business, and sets off toward a brilliant new future that belongs to him.</p>","updated":1794681557,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/95194"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815407","name":"Episode 15"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815408","name":"Episode 16"}}}}},{"id":3823001,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3823001/still-a-family-1x07-episode-7","name":"Episode 7","season":1,"number":7,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-18","airtime":"20:00","airstamp":"2026-11-18T12:00:00+00:00","runtime":46,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3823001"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/86090","name":"Still a Family"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":86090,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/86090/still-a-family","name":"Still a Family","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Comedy","Family"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":46,"premiered":"2026-11-16","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc002006266llu.html","schedule":{"time":"20:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":54,"network":{"id":1282,"name":"CCTV-1","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/651/1629770.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/651/1629770.jpg"},"summary":"<p>In 2008, with China's economy booming, the Sai Duoxi family living on the Jiaodong Peninsula undergoes a dramatic change. A large demolition compensation payment puts the family's old troubles and chronic problems on full display. Sai Duoxi, a domineering and authoritarian father, throws his children's lives into chaos as he fights to preserve his rule over the household. The five pairs of sons and daughters in the Sai family are five different portraits of life. A sudden turn of events then shakes Sai Duoxi's status as \"head of the family,\" while the five pairs of children begin to reconsider the family's generational relationships and confront their own life dilemmas. Ultimately, the Sai family comes to understand that a home is a place of equality and dignity, and that love means family reunion.</p>","updated":1794862540,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/86090"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3823000","name":"Episode 6"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3823001","name":"Episode 7"}}}}},{"id":3823002,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3823002/still-a-family-1x08-episode-8","name":"Episode 8","season":1,"number":8,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-18","airt